{"text": "That is not true, shouted the banker, I bet you two million you could not stay in a prison cell for even five years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you mean it seriously, said the lawyer, I will stay not five, but fifteen years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The bet was agreed, and the banker, who had more millions than he could count, was delighted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later that evening, the banker began to think more seriously. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What is the point of this bet, What will it prove. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For me it was the foolishness of a rich man, and for him it was simple greed for money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was decided that the lawyer would live alone in a small building in the bankers garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He could not see any people, hear human voices, or receive letters or newspapers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But he could have books, music, and wine, and he could ask for them by writing notes through a small window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he left even two minutes early, the banker would not have to pay him anything.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "t", "r", "u", "e", ",", " ", "s", "h", "o", "u", "t", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "a", "n", "k", "e", "r", ",", " ", "I", " ", "b", "e", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "m", "i", "l", "l", "i", "o", "n", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "s", "t", "a", "y", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "p", "r", "i", "s", "o", "n", " ", "c", "e", "l", "l", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "f", "i", "v", "e", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "m", "e", "a", "n", " ", "i", "t", " ", "s", "e", "r", "i", "o", "u", "s", "l", "y", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "